      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Bickleton hosts an annual picnic and rodeo every year since 1910, a tradition that has never been interrupted.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bickleton%2C_Washington",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Bluebird Inn is billed as Washington’s oldest functioning tavern, though it has changed names and owners over time.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
