      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bickleton%2C_Washington",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Bickleton is known as the bluebird capital of the world, with thousands of birdhouses built to attract both mountain and western bluebirds.",
